# Release-critical paths. The `main` branch ruleset requires a code-owner review
# for any pull request that touches these: the build and release pipeline, the
# installers, the dependency locks and the verification docs. A change here can
# alter what ends up in a published binary or how users check it.
#
# (There is deliberately no catch-all `*` owner: ordinary code and docs changes
# go through CI and a pull request, without needing this extra gate.)
